{"posts":[{"id":"luska_p2_26","t":"Possible QM on aussie???","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#26","p":2,"im":["701499fdc17fea75bacd5046ee014d6a99e3a80f"],"m":26},{"id":"luska_p2_27","t":"Gold Scalp","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#27","p":2,"im":["90cbe42e5ca4061538cbbc14f09e074b29381f25"],"m":27},{"id":"luska_p2_28","t":"Stopped out on Gold but Euro, Aussie and Kiwi is in positive... Hello 1.350\n\nADDING more buys when the trendline broken and retested","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#28","p":2,"im":["1661907ee1dd8daa22696e3742ebea2931babf99"],"m":28},{"id":"luska_p2_29","t":"Bought Euro\n\nBroke even and bought again","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#29","p":2,"im":["f4e8e3e592809d1359020015f56dc4f9541e1925","de00fbaafa1804faec0cbfa0fef695fe49665fc5"],"m":29},{"id":"luska_p2_30","t":"Eur Gbp Coming to weekly supply...\n\nAnd guess what??? Inside the supply trim to daily we have a nice low risk entry","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#30","p":2,"im":["5b2f16367c67cc525dd6df1914a22927fe7ed124","3dfcd06e8ba5a4793fbbdd19d9732ebcea88d716"],"m":30},{"id":"luska_p2_31","t":"If next market opens gaps up, i will end my buys at 93.85 and looking to short to the new swing to close the first gap up which should sit nicely at the new swing pivot.","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#31","p":2,"im":["ecb46aacc6bb2c703a90c2140b3655b3fd34905f"],"m":31},{"id":"luska_p2_32","t":"Gold... 1:10 Risk Reward... Protected with some profits just in case it didnt work out...","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#32","p":2,"im":["6a9bfffd7aeb8ad985db012b1304485164e13ed8"],"m":32},{"id":"luska_p2_33","t":"Obvious Long Term Swings...Time to kick in my long term wealth account...","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#33","p":2,"im":["baf74c3d16be66569117c795e7206c124bc2a58a","dd74bba3feb8bb202f1ce9ea3d98b7a9e646dcb9","c514a8b09c36571e934d863bc6fc3c7c71928d2d","e16d3e3609806807d9d109b10110c051ae8be55d","138b9a6bf13817bcaa30dce4f5d8139757885960","f2bf297d0695c36bd73e913a668058dd590edc37","085f5a1e27d438ff51320e459ee199e32df70bdf","a16d621910564d18a1feddd738f4570be8eb666f","c7e1a6760ec5498e5381f783c7e9db75c1f4e69e"],"m":33},{"id":"luska_p2_34","t":"Since the euro is bullish and aussie is kinda bearish, this pair requires some price action to anticipate as price is at supply but has broke the s/r and requires a retest for support... Just probabilities..","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#34","p":2,"im":["4979dc82aa627b48c89dc090622180bb3cdc71ad"],"m":34},{"id":"luska_p2_35","t":"UJ adding buys and running buys. Sold according to strategy i acquire(m15 counter trend skill)...Taking profit At the buy limit which is also a 50% retracement...","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#35","p":2,"im":["a871735b5415ef4533fee3cddd0b0d05f8a44339","b26d2aa40e6a2a66ff3553e71281e147c156ac05"],"m":35},{"id":"luska_p2_36","t":"Scalping euro buy...","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#36","p":2,"im":["12fa89e2c6796ff3e0eea4085ae5eb2b262b05b7"],"m":36},{"id":"luska_p2_37","t":"Bought the breakout... Now waiting for next move... buy protected and mostly taken profit at H1 supply","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#37","p":2,"im":["bbd480d69abbf167b5f2b52cb3fd5006cf5f3d71"],"m":37},{"id":"luska_p2_38","t":"All the way down to the decision area... Nice!","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#38","p":2,"im":["283931f1d1886724735d90cc1ed7a8ffabaff81e","7be552ae98cc16a32b43df6f9e9d1082608d69e0","332db802158ed6dcc8ad99af2a8ec6f10ca801fc","d8bb647ba233b679811f4330dc8b890b97099015","8bd384a69e930d3791fd5a2dab7af00859164e00"],"m":38},{"id":"luska_p2_39","t":"Any fibo experts here??? Notice i have 14% in my fibo levels...it seemsvto be a some kind of significant signal to tell u something... I dunno what...haha","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#39","p":2,"im":[],"m":39},{"id":"luska_p2_40","t":"Hmmmmmm\n\n14% fib. As I recall, it works best when the seventh son of a seventh son is born, and Saturn is rising in Uranus\n\nOnly joking. We've been in and out of fibs and everything else on the market, and we always come back to the truth\n\nPRICE IS EVERYTHING!","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#40","p":2,"im":[],"m":40},{"id":"luska_p2_41","t":"Haha...Agreed... I tend to neglect many tools now... Price speaks everything to u... just need to listen to it...","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#41","p":2,"im":[],"m":41},{"id":"luska_p2_42","t":"Refer to post #7....\n\nWhat have i learn from this chart?:-1) Dont trade everyday 2) Dont overtrade. 3) Cherry pick the trades 4) Market doesnt care how you feel. 5) ( feel free to add)\n\nWhat's my aim from this lesson:-1) The historical low has been made so watch for reversal. 2) Make myself hated by the broker and make them ban me from trading with them. 3) Know your enemy well before u start to go against them. ( Means, think like how they think before eliminating them) ( STOP Thinking like a retail Trader) 4) Never give up.( Thats what most people love to see u do except in RTM)","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#42","p":2,"im":["be395c1491597ba1eff576c07904fd7bc2dea869"],"m":42},{"id":"luska_p2_43","t":"I see Greed at \"Sold Here\" and \" Add Sell at retest\"","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#43","p":2,"im":[],"m":43},{"id":"luska_p2_44","t":"Hi luska, over what period of time did you take those trades? 324 seems like a lot!","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#44","p":2,"im":[],"m":44},{"id":"luska_p2_45","t":"since xmas eve is when i fund this account.Obviously im over trading. every base seems good to me. Anyway im flying off to japan next friday to board a vessel and sail down to malaysia and willl be out of the market till end february. Watever positions i have now will just be left alone since its not wise to add more trades with the remaining margin i have and the negative balance although i have a floating profit of 20% from my initial capital. Im still in a long positing at 88.35 in Usd/Jpy and protected. Worst scenario im left with taxi fare for me to cry home if i got stopped out. During my voyage i will be reviewing my mistakes and im already started to refine my rules. I will still be trading with 500 bux if i need to topup not more until i really make it to triple my account withing 3 months. I dont trust demo accounts as i tend to not take it seriously with virtual money. Money drives motivation. Anyway i feel no regret with the money lost as its the money im willing to lose. I only need to focus more on my emotions. 500 bux fee for a emotion control course.haha. Cya next market open, i will be posting paper trading charts when i have the time and see me kicking the broker's nuts in March.","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#45","p":2,"im":[],"m":45},{"id":"luska_p2_46","t":"I couldnt help when the market screams to buy at me... Last trouble area and i should be able to make a comeback...\\","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#46","p":2,"im":["fb30c0c654887dcc2c4ee897eee9ce04decf773f","19aa1f3774837c19969ea1fc512c8037c3ac9a4b"],"m":46},{"id":"luska_p2_47","t":"Usd/Jpy Analysis...Going Long while the whole world is short...Small risk...Exit 1 @ 95.50 Exit2 @ 96.37","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#47","p":2,"im":["e461bc3b08eca8255a18764a72d3689351f82177","4ba39637d3dbbf4fd0b950cb1b15a8022d78aa68","ea2c1d29f5b810fdb65fd1392c4f6cea6ce2c6bb"],"m":47},{"id":"luska_p2_48","t":"im Still bullish for yen pairs until an up gap establish which didnt close for at least 1 day shall i start looking for shorts...","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#48","p":2,"im":["49be1b8340bdc0b95733f0800fb752f3a6217679","e1f44e4a24feab2ef605e95cf6a77451f8a11b92"],"m":48},{"id":"luska_p2_49","t":"Like i said, i will make a comeback...","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#49","p":2,"im":["63b77574a313bbca216551ec4afb14f10f672d53","5145b26897e351c4f67a4f4a96ff2f5433a24378"],"m":49},{"id":"luska_p2_50","t":"Well what can i say... im better at trading intraday rather than aiming for the moon...I dont really care where its going as i have taken profit both sides...im gonna stick to this instead of mimicking others... Thank you guys for making me realise my mistakes...","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#50","p":2,"im":["2309fa1622af8a7774c43f01299702356be6bc01","2a5e9198770cbcf1bd94904d5a23cce834990b9f"],"m":50}],"image